WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.188
Some regions lag because of

2
00:00:02.188 --> 00:00:03.608
their geography.

3
00:00:03.608 --> 00:00:05.625
India built programmes for those

4
00:00:05.625 --> 00:00:06.617
places.

5
00:00:06.951 --> 00:00:09.992
The Drought Prone Areas Programme

6
00:00:09.992 --> 00:00:11.623
began in 1973.

7
00:00:11.623 --> 00:00:14.975
The Desert Development Programme in

8
00:00:14.975 --> 00:00:16.015
1977.

9
00:00:16.353 --> 00:00:17.902
There's also the Hill Area

10
00:00:17.902 --> 00:00:19.627
Development Programme,

11
00:00:19.627 --> 00:00:21.600
and the tribal sub-plan.

12
00:00:21.938 --> 00:00:24.209
Area plans make sense when

13
00:00:24.209 --> 00:00:25.627
the problem is the land

14
00:00:25.627 --> 00:00:28.055
itself, not only the household.

15
00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:30.021
Your turn.

16
00:00:30.021 --> 00:00:31.712
When did it begin?
